			<div class="content" id="post-content-2178044">
									

<div style="text-align: justify;">
<p>Hi! I like your article, specially because it includes my nationality and this is quite rare. That given, you do have some automated translation errors that i will be happy to correct for you.</p>
<hr />
<blockquote>
<p>Papai, mamãe, nós não sabemos onde ele vive!</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I think you were going for: &quot;Mom, dad, we don't know where he comes from!&quot;<br />
In this case, it would be: &quot;Papai, mamãe, nós não sabemos de onde ele vem!&quot;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-2110-1-E: Mamãe, que está indo sobre?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I think you were going for: &quot;What are you talking about?&quot;<br />
In this case, in Portuguese, it would be: &quot;Mamãe, do que vocês estão falando?&quot;</p>
<p>Even if you weren't going for one of these phrases, just tell me what you meant them to mean and i will tell you the correct phrase in Brazilian Portuguese. They sound very weird.</p>
<hr />
<p>Besides the two mistakes, i like it and i like the concept, so you have my upvote.</p>
</div>

